; 6_voice_game_over — SSG voice approximation: "GAME OVER"
;
; Slow solemn 4-syllable descending cue with extended tails.

T220
V12
O4
L64

; "G-" + "AME" rising vowel             (~350 ms)
P3 F G G+
P0 A B B B B B B A A G F+ F E
P3 R32

; brief intake pause
R32

; "O-" mid vowel                        (~250 ms)
P0 E F F+ G G F+ F E E D D
P3 R64

; "VER" descending vowel close          (~400 ms)
P0 D E D C+ C C < B B B B A+ A G+ G G G F+ F E E
~
